   "g": "RAISE",
   "s": 3,
   "q": "Our platform effect continues to drive further margin expansion across the business and we are therefore upgrading our outlook for the full year and now expect adjusted results in FY 2022 to be materially above current expectations.",
   "file": "20211130_FUTR_Full-Year-Results.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2022-02-03",
   "doc": "AGM",
   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "Full year results are expected to be in line with the Board's expectations with the focus on execution and ongoing platform effect expected to drive further margin progression in FY 2022.",
   "file": "20220203_FUTR_Trading-Update.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2022-05-18",
   "doc": "H1 R",
   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "RAISE",
   "s": 1,
   "q": "Continued strong financial and operational results, guidance reaffirmed with acquisition providing a modest upgrade",
   "file": "20220518_FUTR_Half-Year-Results.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2022-06-17",
   "doc": "Q3 TU",
   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "In addition, the Group continues to benefit from the effect of its diversified audiences and revenue streams, its operating leverage, excellent cash conversion and strong balance sheet. As a result, Future reconfirms it is on track to achieve full-year 2022 guidance.",
   "file": "20220617_FUTR_Completion-of-Acquisition-&-Trading-update.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2022-09-13",
   "doc": "YE-TU",
   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "RAISE",
   "s": 1,
   "q": "As a result, the Group expects full year adjusted operating profit to be at the top end of market expectations*.",
   "file": "20220913_FUTR_Trading-Update.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2022-11-30",
   "doc": "FY R",
   "fy": "FY23",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "\"Looking ahead, whilst we are monitoring the macroeconomic climate, we remain confident in our strategy and the growth opportunities that we are uniquely placed to capitalise on, which we expect to deliver modest profit growth and market share gains.\"",
   "file": "20221130_FUTR_Full-Year-Results.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2023-02-08",
