   "fy": "FY23",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": -1,
   "q": "Overall revenue performance in the period has been broadly in-line with expectations reflecting the strength and diversity of the Group.",
   "file": "20230208_FUTR_AGM-trading-statement.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2023-05-18",
   "doc": "H1 R",
   "fy": "FY23",
   "g": "CUT",
   "s": -2,
   "q": "As a result, we expect full year performance to be towards the bottom end of current market expectations.",
