   "doc": "YE-TU",
   "fy": "FY23",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": -1,
   "q": "Adjusted operating profit is expected to be in line with the Board's expectations1, delivering a resilient performance despite continued macroeconomic volatility impacting our sector.",
